				<guid>http://localhost:1313/posts/image-workflow/</guid>
				<description>&lt;p&gt;The &lt;code&gt;site-image&lt;/code&gt; shortcode always points into &lt;code&gt;static/site-images/&lt;/code&gt;, so content does not need hardcoded theme paths.&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;figure class=&#34;site-image&#34;&gt;&#xA;  &lt;img src=&#34;http://localhost:1313/site-images/hero.png&#34; alt=&#34;Workspace preview&#34; loading=&#34;lazy&#34; /&gt;&#xA;  &lt;figcaption&gt;Replace the file in &lt;code&gt;static/site-images/&lt;/code&gt; and every reference stays valid.&lt;/figcaption&gt;&#xA;&lt;/figure&gt;&#xA;&#xA;&lt;h2 id=&#34;usage&#34;&gt;Usage&lt;/h2&gt;&#xA;&lt;div class=&#34;highlight&#34;&gt;&lt;pre tabindex=&#34;0&#34; class=&#34;chroma&#34;&gt;&lt;code class=&#34;language-md&#34; data-lang=&#34;md&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;line&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;ln&#34;&gt;1&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;cl&#34;&gt;&lt;figure class=&#34;site-image&#34;&gt;&#xA;  &lt;img src=&#34;http://localhost:1313/site-images/hero.png&#34; alt=&#34;Workspace preview&#34; loading=&#34;lazy&#34; /&gt;&#xA;&lt;/figure&gt;&#xA;&#xA;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/div&gt;</description>
